[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-36015"] :question/problem "Identify the surface $4{x}^{2}+8{y}^{2}+2{z}^{2}-8x+8z+4=0.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we complete the square in the $x$ and $z$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}+8{y}^{2}+2{z}^{2}-8x+8z+4 & =0 \\\\ 4({x}^{2}-2x)+8{y}^{2}+2({z}^{2}+4z)+4 & =0 \\\\ 4[(x-1)^{2}-1]+8{y}^{2}+2[(z+2)^{2}-4]+4 & =0 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}-4+8{y}^{2}+2(z+2)^{2}-8+4 & =0 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}+8{y}^{2}+2(z+2)^{2}-8 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by rearranging, we get the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(x-1)^{2}+8{y}^{2}+2(z+2)^{2}-8 & =0 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}+8{y}^{2}+2(z+2)^{2} & =8 \\\\ \\frac{4(x-1)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{8{y}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{2(z+2)^{2}}{8} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{2}+{y}^{2}+\\frac{(z+2)^{2}}{4} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of an ellipsoid centered at $(1,0,-2).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-164543/selection/e4c14cfe0c39f664a7a530d2eb29b4f7dff4d93de1033793873a83d494784620" :answer/id #uuid "7b6a4dd6-e93c-53d2-93f4-e65d3bf0bdfc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164543/selection/603c6fdb6684d49edbe8ce0a1e63614161d5e02f0de9c7602701f18715e787a9" :answer/id #uuid "e6d6f6c9-7294-57c5-97ec-e95d45e9010d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164543/selection/788871369237d819aa13145599cf12680e7d36944c9bf5193687b612f9321665" :answer/id #uuid "05abe101-a679-5d20-ad6f-15cce82f5363" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164543/selection/28e8c86fb776da4d1d0755224f7c2eb8c8ee48df1fbdf295a32cb7101d44231c" :answer/id #uuid "794382d4-742b-53e8-9753-220a115e6567" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164543/selection/04284360b891c205c79256b2efdeea6ada2f0deb599c252d48f0fef0cca935ef" :answer/id #uuid "89af1e7c-c3a1-5339-bb8b-267da86d4daf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164543/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f1f48ec-f198-5132-baa6-5342954a551c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-164543/selection/788871369237d819aa13145599cf12680e7d36944c9bf5193687b612f9321665" :answer-field/choices ["q-164543/selection/e4c14cfe0c39f664a7a530d2eb29b4f7dff4d93de1033793873a83d494784620" "q-164543/selection/603c6fdb6684d49edbe8ce0a1e63614161d5e02f0de9c7602701f18715e787a9" "q-164543/selection/788871369237d819aa13145599cf12680e7d36944c9bf5193687b612f9321665" "q-164543/selection/28e8c86fb776da4d1d0755224f7c2eb8c8ee48df1fbdf295a32cb7101d44231c" "q-164543/selection/04284360b891c205c79256b2efdeea6ada2f0deb599c252d48f0fef0cca935ef"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-164543" :question/id #uuid "04bdbcd8-5184-50ec-95c0-30cd62912fcf" :question/math-academy-id "q-164543" :question/problem "Identify the following surface:\n\n$$\n4{y}^{2}-3{z}^{2}=1,\\,-\\infty <x<\\infty .\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of a hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nThus, a hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis and $b=\\frac{1}{2},\\,c=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-164543/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89fbf42b-d171-5772-87ce-cf622b720963"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-164543"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-164546"] :question/problem "Identify the following surface:\n\n$$\n{z}^{2}=8x,\\,-\\infty <y<\\infty .\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=4py.\n$$\n\nThus, a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $y$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n{z}^{2}=4px.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $y$-axis and $p=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-164553/selection/b8717f4528d891b0aaa1b918803861b6c112a387892a3538b9452462b8f92b86" :answer/id #uuid "4c5b3b90-c0cf-58d2-8dc9-9c06bb449cdb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperboloid of two sheet centered at $(-2,0,1)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164553/selection/4d221cc4e44fa7123bcf37c840c3898990b0c53fc74e2cda29beb65718130830" :answer/id #uuid "c15cb172-fd51-5d68-80e9-8ec8a7524ecd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,1)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164553/selection/ead60f4efac7d5b2080d4631751cbdcb0fa8a8433648598280e48c3a086851d8" :answer/id #uuid "a9b83159-4a2d-5b01-8fa3-91cb0c875eae" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cone centered at $(-2,1,1)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164553/selection/002473cfc7448f6f9f621067f8d76555a676823220101380a5d16d4948968310" :answer/id #uuid "c07a0479-c158-5418-8e34-3cb54ed63446" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,-1)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-164553/selection/d81606bfb7250f88f1255a713b64c76fad0ef32a348d82cd3b389c78c03a3d32" :answer/id #uuid "a1881301-07f4-5c0b-8692-093388d99a9a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $(-2